//! id:        cfg_wiring_undeclared_action_reject
//! section:   16_config
//! expect:    reject
//! error:     ConfigError
//! manifest:  tools.search.driver=mock; actions.Search.tool=search
//! spec:      §6b, §17.1 (an [actions.NAME]/[events.NAME] wiring must name a DECLARED action or event; wiring an undeclared name is a ConfigError)
